@PublicAPI(stability="alpha")
class TrialRuntimeOptions:
    """Runtime configuration parameters for individual training trials.

    These settings apply whether running a single trainable or as part of
    a hyperparameter tuning job. Configuration persists across trial resumes.

    Args:
        experiment_name: Name identifying the experiment/trial.
        storage_path: Local directory for storing results (defaults to ~/ray_results).
        termination_criteria: Conditions under which to stop a trial.
        event_handlers: List of callback functions to invoke during execution.
        error_handling: Settings related to fault tolerance and retry logic.
        sync_options: Configuration for remote syncing of results.
    """
